# Headers do preview Cloudflare (Workers Static Assets).
# O Vite copia este arquivo para dist/ verbatim; o Workers aplica as regras.
# Regras com host workers.dev valem SOMENTE no preview (X-Robots-Tag noindex).
# O deploy Hostinger/nginx ignora este arquivo (headers la: ver Dockerfile.frontend).
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
https://:version.:subdomain.workers.dev/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
